  "problem": "Which of the following sequences diverge?\n\nI. ${a}_{n}=\\frac{n+3{n}^{2}}{2-n}$ for $n\\ge 1$\n\nII. ${a}_{n}=\\frac{5}{{n}^{6}}$ for $n\\ge 1$\n\nIII. ${a}_{n}=\\frac{2-n}{{n}^{2}+1}$ for $n\\ge 1$",
